UPPER - upper-case a string: string in, string out.

Language features
  - SEED_EXPORT with a string argument (snapshotted to scratch)
  - a string return via set_return_str, read back with CALL$

Try it
  SEED h%, "UPPER.SED"
    PRINT CALL$(h%, "berry")     -> BERRY

Build it on the machine
  grow upper          # -> build/UPPER.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as UPPER.SED, ready to use.

